&lt;p&gt;As an Account Executive on our Enterprise Retail team, you will manage the full sales cycle from prospecting to close. Your portfolio will include both prospective and strategic existing customers within Braze’s large Enterprise segment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is designed for a SaaS Sales professional with a proven track record in generating new business through strong prospecting and business development skills. Ideal candidates will have 8+ years of experience selling complex SaaS solutions to enterprise clients, with typical deal sizes ranging exceeding $1M+ per year. Additionally, candidates should possess at least 10 years of overall industry experience, ideally with a focus on Retail &amp;amp; Consumer Goods verticals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are particularly interested in individuals who have worked with enterprise organizations and understand how to navigate complex, cross-functional stakeholder and decision-making committees. Experience selling solutions that engage stakeholders across both IT and business departments is highly valued. Familiarity with analytics, CRM, marketing automation, customer data management, digital media, or content marketing solutions would be an excellent fit. Prior experience should also include routine collaboration with marketing, partnerships, and business development teams to help accelerate lead generation efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and nurture trusted relationships with C-suite executives at top-tier brands, understanding their organizational complexities and procurement processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and pursue net-new enterprise accounts through targeted prospecting and outbound efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage relationships with high-profile accounts while actively seeking new opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement a consultative sales approach to identify priority business challenges and take a value-based approach to solution selling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal and external teams to ensure a seamless client experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive account expansion within assigned accounts using market insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educate clients on industry trends, positioning Braze as a trusted partner &amp;amp; ecosystem leader&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize Salesforce.com, Clari, and other CRM tools to manage sales pipelines and ensure accurate forecasting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8-10 years in strategic SaaS sales, focusing on large enterprise clients, ideally with a focus on Retail &amp;amp; Consumer Goods verticals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in complex solution selling, with a strong background in Value Selling and Business Value Assessments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to source and prospect new accounts through effective outbound strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding verbal, written, and presentation skills for articulating technical concepts &amp;amp; positive business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quick adaptability to new cloud applications and tools, with experience in Salesforce.com or similar CRMs, as well as leveraging AI for productivity gains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong networking skills, able to navigate large organizations and identify key decision-makers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up-to-date understanding of the digital and application landscape, as well as consumer trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;For candidates based in the United States, the pay range for this position at the start of employment is expected to be between $150,000 and $181,000/year, with an expected On Target Earnings (OTE) between $300,000 and $362,000/year (including bonus or commission). Your exact offer may vary depending on multiple individualized factors, including market location, job-related knowledge, skills, and experience. In addition to cash compensation, this role qualifies for a comprehensive Total Rewards package that includes equity grants of restricted stock (RSUs) so that you will own a piece of our company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
