&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will have at least 5 years experience selling, renewing and expanding SaaS solutions to clients in a variety of different verticals in the mid-market, commercial or enterprise segment. Ideally, this experience will include collaboration with Customer Success, Business Development, and Marketing teams’ into the lead generation process.&lt;/p&gt;
