&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with additional internal departments, including but not limited to Solutions Consulting, Implementation &amp;amp; Onboarding, RevOps, Product, Legal and Marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate resources to drive feature exploration and adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve quarterly upsell and renewals targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Occasionally travel for onsite customer engagement, meeting with and selling to existing customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
