&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor to the Sales Team and subject matter expert on all Deal Desk processes, best practices, and systems (e.g. Salesforce, DealHub, DocuSign, Conga Composer)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist the Sales Team in building non-standard or complex orders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with administrative tasks including managing Salesforce for data integrity, updating accounts, editing reports, assistance with customer consumption and overage tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Sales Team with contract signature process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional departments to learn business needs and help facilitate the deal process (e.g. structuring deals/contracts, approvals, and order management)&lt;/li&gt;
