&lt;li&gt;You are proficient in Excel and Google Sheets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CRM systems like Salesforce.com&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a team player who loves to collaborate cross-functionally and globally to support the broader team&#39;s goals&lt;/li&gt;
