&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU HAVE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5–7+ years of experience in an operational, technical, or customer-facing role supporting a technical product, ideally within a SaaS, mobile, marketing automation, or email technology environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience owning complex operational issues end-to-end, using sound judgment to navigate ambiguity, balance competing priorities, and deliver high-quality outcomes for customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of email systems and/or messaging infrastructure, with the ability to diagnose issues, understand technical concepts, and partner effectively with engineering, product, support, and other technical teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to influence decisions, build alignment across teams, communicate effectively with both technical and non-technical audiences, and drive resolution on complex or high-impact issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to identify operational gaps and drive meaningful improvements, including developing scalable processes, improving tooling and workflows, reducing recurring issues, and raising the quality and efficiency of operational execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly analytical and data-driven, with experience defining and monitoring meaningful metrics, using data to identify trends and root causes, and translating insights into clear actions that improve business and customer outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving and decision-making skills, with a track record of independently navigating ambiguous problems, identifying root causes, evaluating tradeoffs, and determining appropriate solutions without requiring significant direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on and execution-oriented, while operating with a broader ownership mindset: able to manage day-to-day operational responsibilities while simultaneously identifying opportunities to improve the systems, processes, and customer experience around them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated leadership through influence, including mentoring or enabling teammates, establishing best practices, sharing knowledge, and raising the operational bar across the broader organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong sense of ownership and accountability, with the ability to set priorities, manage multiple workstreams, communicate risks proactively, and consistently deliver against measurable goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the Braze ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of SparkPost, SendGrid, and/or Amazon Simple Email Services email systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with other tools like FinancialForce, Tray.io, Looker, Slackbots, PagerDuty, etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
