&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Braze, we have found our people. We’re a genuinely approachable, exceptionally kind, and intensely passionate crew.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We seek to ignite that passion by setting high standards, championing teamwork, and creating work-life harmony as we collectively navigate rapid growth on a global scale while striving for greater equity and opportunity – inside and outside our organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To flourish here, you must be prepared to set a high bar for yourself and those around you. There is always a way to contribute: Acting with autonomy, having accountability and being open to new perspectives are essential to our continued success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our deep curiosity to learn and our eagerness to share diverse passions with others gives us balance and injects a one-of-a-kind vibrancy into our culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are driven to solve exhilarating challenges and have a bias toward action in the face of change, you will be empowered to make a real impact here, with a sharp and passionate team at your back. If Braze sounds like a place where you can thrive, we can’t wait to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;Drive Enterprise Outbound Pipeline: Systematically research, map, and prospect into high-value target accounts to generate qualified enterprise opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot;&gt;Master the Dual Motion: Seamlessly balance multi-stakeholder, long-term strategic deal cycles with a steady, disciplined run-rate of transactional wins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot;&gt;Architect Complex Enterprise Deals: Conduct rigorous discovery, execute Business Value Assessments (BVAs), build compelling ROI frameworks, and lead commercial negotiations with C-suite executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot;&gt;Leverage the Ecosystem: Actively co-sell and orchestrate sales strategies with strategic partners (SIs, digital agencies, cloud providers, and technology alliances) to expand coverage and accelerate deal execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot;&gt;Mobilize Stakeholders: Navigate matrixed enterprise organizations to cultivate C-level sponsors, build internal champions, and align disparate technical and commercial groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0&quot;&gt;Execute Value Selling: Translate complex technical, architectural, and data capabilities into measurable strategic outcomes that resonate with business leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;Strategic Enterprise SaaS Experience: Proven track record of consistently exceeding quotas by selling large-scale SaaS solutions to top-tier enterprise clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot;&gt;Master of Complex Deal Construction &amp;amp; Value Selling: You excel in Value Selling frameworks, ROI quantification, and Business Value Assessments (BVAs) to justify multi-year, complex investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot;&gt;Relentless Pipeline Creator: You take full ownership of your domain with strong outbound strategies, cold outreach precision, and active networking to build sustainable top-of-funnel coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot;&gt;Partner &amp;amp; Ecosystem Collaborator: You have a proven history of leveraging global and regional system integrators, agencies, and tech partners throughout the sales cycle to accelerate velocity and expand deal size.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot;&gt;Dual-Motion Execution: You are ambidextrous—equally skilled at nurturing complex, high-ACV transformational deals and driving a steady cadence of enterprise run-rate conversions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,5,0&quot;&gt;Strong Networker &amp;amp; Stakeholder Mobilizer: You intuitively understand modern enterprise buying behavior, effortlessly identifying key decision-makers, building champions, and connecting at industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,6,0&quot;&gt;Articulate &amp;amp; Tech-Savvy Communicator: Exceptional written, verbal, and executive presentation skills. You simplify complex cloud/data architectures into tangible business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,7,0&quot;&gt;Adaptable &amp;amp; Modern Tech Stack Fluent: Highly proficient with Salesforce.com and sales acceleration platforms, with a forward-thinking approach to leveraging AI for personal productivity and market research.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,8,0&quot;&gt;Domain Knowledgeable: Up-to-date on the modern digital landscape, mobile app ecosystems, consumer tech trends, CRM, MarTech, and data architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,8,0&quot;&gt;Domestic Mobility: Willingness to travel nationally across Brazil for on-site client visits, executive alignments, and key industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
