&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We move fast, we work hard, and we love our jobs. If that sounds like your kind of team, we&#39;d love to meet you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;For candidates based in the United States, the pay range for this position at the start of employment is expected to be between $127,000 and $179,000/year, with an expected On Target Earnings (OTE) between $146,000 and $208,000/year (including bonus or commission).Your exact offer may vary depending on multiple individualized factors, including market location, job-related knowledge, skills, and experience. In addition to cash compensation, this role qualifies for a comprehensive Total Rewards package that includes equity grants of restricted stock (RSUs) so that you will own a piece of our company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
