&lt;li&gt;Accountable for team KPIs across platform adoption, gross/net renewal, expansion, and customer advocacy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze the team&#39;s book of business to proactively mitigate churn risks and pursue growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
