&lt;li&gt;Act as the senior escalation point for critical account issues within your team’s portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for customer use cases internally with Product, Engineering, and cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Value &amp;amp; Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with senior customer executives, ensuring clients continuously achieve value from Braze.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide CSMs in driving independent platform adoption and technical integration across the customer lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement process improvements to scale Customer Success operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
