&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Braze, we have found our people. We’re a genuinely approachable, exceptionally kind, and intensely passionate crew.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We seek to ignite that passion by setting high standards, championing teamwork, and creating work-life harmony as we collectively navigate rapid growth on a global scale while striving for greater equity and opportunity – inside and outside our organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To flourish here, you must be prepared to set a high bar for yourself and those around you. There is always a way to contribute: Acting with autonomy, having accountability and being open to new perspectives are essential to our continued success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our deep curiosity to learn and our eagerness to share diverse passions with others gives us balance and injects a one-of-a-kind vibrancy into our culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are driven to solve exhilarating challenges and have a bias toward action in the face of change, you will be empowered to make a real impact here, with a sharp and passionate team at your back. If Braze sounds like a place where you can thrive, we can’t wait to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;As a Manager in our Global Customer Support team, you will play a crucial role in leading a local team of support specialists committed to fostering strong post-sale technical relationships with our customers. You will ensure your team consistently hits their KPIs, conduct regular 1:1s, deliver actionable feedback, map career development paths, and set and review team OKRs. You will proactively address performance, champion talent growth, and lead hiring and onboarding for the local team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;People Leadership &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead, mentor, and coach a high-performing support team, instilling a growth mindset and driving continuous technical and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Operational &amp;amp; KPI Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor team performance and operational rigor, ensuring key support metrics (CSAT, CES, first response, and resolution times) meet and exceed target benchmarks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Escalation Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a critical escalation point for complex technical customer issues, driving root-cause resolution while keeping internal and external stakeholders aligned.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with global support leaders, Customer Success, Product, and Engineering across multiple regions and time zones to streamline processes and advocate for team standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Process &amp;amp; Knowledge Sharing:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive documentation accuracy, process standardization, and knowledge-centered support (KCS) practices across the regional and global support teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Leadership Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience managing and mentoring technical support teams, preferably within a high-growth B2B SaaS environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;People &amp;amp; Culture Champion:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record in talent recruitment, onboarding, performance management, and cultivating a collaborative, growth-oriented team culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Escalation &amp;amp; Case Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep expertise in handling critical, time-sensitive technical escalations, with in-depth knowledge of case management and knowledge-centered support processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Metrics &amp;amp; Process Driven:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid understanding of core support KPIs (CSAT, CES, time to resolution) and experience standardizing support workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Tools &amp;amp; Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency with ticketing and CRM platforms (e.g., Salesforce, Zendesk).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Communication Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional verbal and written communication skills in English, with the ability to explain complex technical concepts clearly to both technical and executive audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Technical Familiarity (Plus):&lt;/strong&gt; Exposure to HTML, CSS, JavaScript, APIs, SQL, or tools like Postman, Snowflake, and Kibana is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,7,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,7,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Workplace:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to work a hybrid schedule from the São Paulo office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
