&lt;p&gt;Our deep curiosity to learn and our eagerness to share diverse passions with others gives us balance and injects a one-of-a-kind vibrancy into our culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are driven to solve exhilarating challenges and have a bias toward action in the face of change, you will be empowered to make a real impact here, with a sharp and passionate team at your back. If Braze sounds like a place where you can thrive, we can’t wait to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As Regional Partner Account Director for LATAM, you will own the regional amplification of Braze&#39;s global platinum partner strategy across every platinum-tier partner active in the region (Deloitte, WPP, Publicis, Merkle, and future platinum partners). Reporting to the AVP of Delivery, you will take the global account plan set by each Global Partner Account Director (GPAD) and adapt it locally across LATAM&#39;s markets. You will collaborate closely with GPADs, the AVP of Partner Sales for AMER, and regional Partner Sales Managers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Key responsibilities:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Regional Platinum Coverage:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the senior Braze relationship owner for every platinum-tier delivery partner operating in LATAM.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Amplifying the Global Account Plan:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate global partner strategies into execution across LATAM markets (Brazil, Mexico, Southern Cone, and Andean markets), identifying key regional practice leads, market priorities, and local delivery capability gaps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Certification &amp;amp; Delivery Quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with Partner Services and Global Learning &amp;amp; Enablement to ensure LATAM-based consultants are certified and that Partner-Led Delivery engagements maintain high quality standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Pipeline Activation:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with the AVP, Partner Sales and Partner Sales Managers to integrate the right platinum partner into regional sales opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Feedback to Global Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Surface regional market dynamics, delivery friction, and resource needs to GPADs to ensure global account plans accurately reflect LATAM considerations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Regional Escalation Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the first line of escalation for platinum partner issues in LATAM, resolving regional matters locally and escalating global decisions appropriately.&lt;/p&gt;
