&lt;li&gt;Develop mutually agreed-upon, win-win Joint Business Plans (JBPs) with partners, outlining shared objectives, success measures, stakeholders, methods, and review cadences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incorporate Growth Plans, Partner Marketing, Awareness &amp;amp; Enablement, Partner-Led Opportunities (PLO) and Customer Success objectives into JBPs where relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with marketing to develop an annual Partner Marketing Calendar - and engage partners to participate and sponsor Braze-owned events, Braze x Partner specific events, Industry events and sponsor Partner events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel frequently to build in-person relationships and a presence in your allocated markets across SEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement a Strategic Partner plan for all of your Countries for each Half.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess a strong understanding of team territory, including existing customers, Target A &amp;amp; B accounts, and overlapping tech/services integrations via Crossbeam.&lt;/li&gt;
