&lt;li&gt;Coach AEs on Partner Engagement Best Practices, including where partners are incumbent in their prospects and which partners to engage for co-seller and co-delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively engage senior stakeholders within our partner ecosystem, aligning with their priorities and the value partnering with Braze offers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify gaps and opportunities within our Partner Ecosystem to continue to grow and build our Partner Network&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong, trusted relationships with our Partner Leads and contacts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run account mapping, enablement and QBR sessions to understand where we have overlap with both Technology and Agency Partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
