&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensures end-to-end transparency.&lt;/strong&gt; You maintain clear and dependable tracking of progress, status, and risks, flagging delays early alongside practical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leads through influence and trust.&lt;/strong&gt; You motivate senior leaders to hit deadlines by making collaboration seamless and consistently delivering value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Balances strategy with tactical detail.&lt;/strong&gt; You seamlessly transition from managing detailed operational schedules to briefing executives on complex cross-functional dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Upholds strict confidentiality.&lt;/strong&gt; You handle sensitive and unreleased information with complete discretion and earn executive trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Who You Are&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-8 years in program management, project management or strategy and operations roles at a B2B SaaS or technology company, ideally supporting a go-to-market, partnerships or alliances team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has driven cross-functional programs from brief to delivery with several stakeholders and senior people, and has run events or company moments with speakers, content and a tight timeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has built visibility across a portfolio of workstreams, using trackers, status reporting and tools such as Jira, and knows how to keep them honest without making them a burden&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong writer and storyteller, able to turn updates and numbers into something leaders grasp quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at facilitation: you run meetings with senior people, keep them to time, and leave with clear actions and owners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven, comfortable building trackers and spotting when numbers don&#39;t add up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organised, able to manage many deadlines and very different kinds of work at once without losing detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Happy to build process from nothing, and pragmatic about keeping it light enough to survive a busy quarter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with the tools that run a department, such as Google Workspace, Slack, Jira and Confluence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;For candidates based in the United States, the pay range for this position at the start of employment is expected to be between $92,000 and $131,200/year, with an expected On Target Earnings (OTE) between $115,000 and $164,000/year (including bonus or commission). Your exact offer may vary depending on multiple individualized factors, including market location, job-related knowledge, skills, and experience. In addition to cash compensation, this role qualifies for a comprehensive Total Rewards package that includes equity grants of restricted stock (RSUs) so that you will own a piece of our company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
