&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring Manager Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate closely with hiring managers to understand team priorities, define ideal candidate profiles, and implement best-in-class recruiting strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
