&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Broader Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Opportunities to support regional APAC recruiting initiatives and participate in cross-functional HR projects beyond talent acquisition in the future.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
