&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bilingual Capability:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluency in Japanese (native-level or equivalent) and professional working proficiency in English to engage with local candidates and communicate with global stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Mindset &amp;amp; Curiosity:&lt;/strong&gt; Eager to learn, open to feedback, and willing to try new approaches as the recruitment market evolves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic &amp;amp; Analytical Thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to track and analyze recruiting metrics to resolve pipeline bottlenecks and contribute to broader recruitment strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execution &amp;amp; Organization:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong organizational skills and attention to detail, with a proven ability to prioritize competing demands in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience engaging with or supporting senior leadership is highly preferred. (does not need to be limited to recruiting contexts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
