&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;The Enterprise BDR in the LATAM team is the engine behind Braze&#39;s large company growth. You&#39;ll partner with Account Executives to identify, engage, and qualify prospects at companies with 5,000+ employees, helping leading B2C brands discover how Braze can transform their customer engagement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;This is a high-impact, remote role where you&#39;ll blend volume-driven outreach with personalized, consultative prospecting. You&#39;ll research strategic accounts, craft relevant messaging, and create opportunities that directly fuel Braze&#39;s regional pipeline across LATAM.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;Main responsibilities:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Enterprise Outbound Prospecting:&lt;/strong&gt; Prospect into Enterprise (5,000+ employees) target accounts across key industries such as retail, media, fintech, and travel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Pipeline &amp;amp; Meeting Generation:&lt;/strong&gt; Generate qualified meetings for the Enterprise AE team through multi-channel outbound outreach (email, phone, LinkedIn, video).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Account Research:&lt;/strong&gt; Research accounts to identify pain points around customer engagement, cross-channel messaging, and data activation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategic Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with Account Executives and marketing to develop territory strategies and prioritize high-potential accounts across the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;CRM &amp;amp; Data Hygiene:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain accurate activity, prospecting notes, and pipeline data in Salesforce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;WHAT SUCCESS LOOKS LIKE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot;&gt;Consistently hitting or exceeding monthly qualified meeting and pipeline targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot;&gt;Building a repeatable outreach motion that balances efficiency, volume, and thoughtful personalization.&lt;/p&gt;
