&lt;p&gt;This is a SaaS enterprise sales leadership role, managing a team of Enterprise Account Executives in the DACH market for Braze’s market-leading Customer Journey Orchestration platform. We’re looking for someone who is passionate about helping brands communicate more effectively with their customers, building a winning team, and expanding our highly successful customer base.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will have at least 5 years of successful experience leading and developing a team of enterprise sellers in a high-growth, rapidly evolving, and dynamically competitive market. Your team will focus on the entire lifecycle relationship with their clients, so you should have experience helping them develop and evangelize net-new business, while nurturing and expanding the relationships with their customer base. As a front-line leader whose team addresses the problems of customers across multiple industries—with a strong strategic emphasis on Retail and CPG—you should have strong business acumen, and help prepare for, and participate directly in, customer-facing engagements. Your leadership will have a direct impact on the success of our customers, the development of your team, and the success of Braze.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead &amp;amp; Scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and mentor a distributed team of 6+ Account Executives across the DACH market (e.g., Munich, Berlin), driving performance across Strategic, Enterprise, and Commercial account segments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spearhead Expansion:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the strategic expansion of Braze in Central Europe, specifically dominating the Retail and CPG verticals to solidify our position as the undisputed category leader.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Evangelism:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the definitive face and voice of Braze for the Retail and CPG sector in the region. You will be the go-to leader for GTM initiatives, headlining industry events, and leading internal and external evangelism.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Enforce disciplined deal execution, sales forecasting, pipeline management, and structured sales methodologies to ensure predictable revenue and cross-functional alignment with revenue operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage the Ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with and expand an ecosystem of System Integrators (SIs), Technology Partners, and Digital Agencies to drive joint GTM strategies and accelerate revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Lifecycle Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive full-lifecycle customer engagement from prospecting and acquisition to retention and expansion, actively participating in complex, C-level customer meetings and negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Foster deep alignment with internal teams including Business Development, Marketing, Customer Success, Legal, Sales Operations, and Partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
