&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experienced Leader:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of experience leading enterprise sales teams in the DACH market, specifically managing teams of 6+ people across Strategic, Enterprise, and Commercial accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent Magnet:&lt;/strong&gt; A proven track record as a true &quot;talent magnet&quot;—capable of acquiring, developing, coaching, and retaining top-performing sales talent in a fiercely competitive market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retail &amp;amp; CPG Authority:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record selling complex enterprise solutions into the Retail and CPG sectors. Direct industry background is welcomed, but an intricate understanding of these verticals is essential. Existing executive relationships within DACH Retail/CPG are a significant advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Network:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of the MarTech partner landscape for Retail and CPG, bringing established relationships with key SIs, Tech Partners, and Agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Sales Tech Innovator:&lt;/strong&gt; Forward-thinking approach to sales tech, utilizing AI-driven tools to enhance operational efficiency, accelerate deal execution, and continuously refine the sales process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Distributed Team Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience successfully leading and unifying distributed sales teams across multiple strategic DACH locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Precision:&lt;/strong&gt; Native German and fluent English are mandatory, allowing you to seamlessly navigate C-level negotiations in both. French language skills are highly regarded as a strong bonus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of SaaS sales cycles, Customer Data Platforms (CDPs), omnichannel marketing, and modern customer engagement stacks.&lt;/li&gt;
