&lt;li&gt;Strong external presence and a natural ability to build trusted relationships through professional communities, social channels, events, and industry networks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with current digital, mobile, AI, customer-engagement, and application-market trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in a startup, scale-up, or high-growth technology company is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
