&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech &amp;amp; Tool Adaptability:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficient with Salesforce.com or similar CRMs, sales technology stacks, and emerging cloud applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Navigation:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong networking capabilities with a knack for navigating matrixed enterprise organizations to identify key decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
