&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;For candidates based in the United States, the pay range for this position at the start of employment is expected to be between $117,000 and $184,000/year, with an expected On Target Earnings (OTE) between $231,000 and $362,000/year (including bonus or commission). Your exact offer may vary depending on multiple individualized factors, including market location, job-related knowledge, skills, and experience. In addition to cash compensation, this role qualifies for a comprehensive Total Rewards package that includes equity grants of restricted stock (RSUs) so that you will own a piece of our company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
