&lt;li&gt;Spend time with customers:&amp;nbsp;You treat customer time as a priority, not a luxury, and you bring what you learn back into the messaging, the playbook, and the roadmap conversation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How Success Is Measured&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can measure and report on your work, and you hold yourself accountable to business outcomes — not activity. Success in this role is measured against pipeline, product adoption, pipeline progression, and overall program impact, and you&#39;ll be expected to show that connection clearly and consistently.&lt;/p&gt;
