&lt;li&gt;Professional experience with Ruby on Rails, Python, React, Snowflake, microservice architecture, and distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with modern data warehousing, BI, and analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with agile processes&lt;/li&gt;
